// MUST be second, immediately after the defs.  It defines the QC functions
// `precache_model` and `setmodel` (the defs bind the builtins as *_raw), so any
// unit compiled ahead of it would bind straight to nothing.  See its header.
shared/sh_modellist.qc
// ...and the sound half, same rule: it owns `sound`, `precache_sound` and (in
// CSQC) `localsound`, so nothing may be compiled ahead of it either.
