// is load-bearing.  Also after sv_customkeys.qc, whose "$" store trigger_save
// reads through, and after sv_triggers.qc for Trigger_UseTargets.
//
// Its store is a QC global array backed by a FILE, and the file is not an
// optimisation: SV_SpawnServer calls PR_Deinit on every map load (engine
