// bolted on), and QC forward-declares neither.  The driver code in
// sv_func_traincontrols.qc reaches back into this file by forward declaration,
// which is legal, and the one FIELD that has to cross the boundary the other
// way (.tt_is_vehicle) is declared in sv_func_tracktrain.qc for the same reason.
