// them rather than redeclaring.  BEFORE sv_use.qc, which calls Inv_TryPickup
// for the +use half of collection, and before sv_player.qc, which drops the
// inventory on death and owns the `inventory` / `dropitem` commands; both of
// those reach it by forward declaration, but sv_player.qc also READS its
// player fields, which it could not do from earlier in the list.
// The InventoryRules KEY FIELDS are not here at all — the eleven classes that
// honour them compile as early as position 185, so they live in
