// The monster half of the look-at name tag.  AFTER sv_monsters.qc for
// Monster_DisplayName and the .displayname field; before sv_main.qc, which is the
// only caller (one line in the per-frame per-player walk).
server/sv_lookatnpc.qc
// Sven's per-monster sound replacement layer.  After sv_monsters.qc because it
// reads .sl_table, before the AI layer because AI_SndPlay and every class voice
// handler emit through its AI_Sound chokepoint.  sv_monsters.qc calls back into
// it through a forward-declared Soundlist_Load, the same way it reaches AI_Spawn.
server/sv_soundlist.qc
// AI layer.  AFTER sv_monsters.qc, not before: these files read its per-monster
// keys (.gag, .bloodcolor, .displayname) and QC requires a FIELD to be declared
// before use.  The other direction needs no ordering at all - sv_monsters.qc
// reaches the AI layer through forward-declared FUNCTIONS only, and touches none
// of its arrays.  All of them must stay after server/sv_navnodes.qc, which owns
// nav_pos[] and the path-slot pool.
server/sv_ai_sched.qc
server/sv_ai_anim.qc
server/sv_ai_move.qc
// Monster attack primitives.  After sv_ai_move.qc, before sv_ai_core.qc: it
// needs the AI fields and constants, and the class files below call into it.
// Faction matrix.  Before sv_ai_core.qc, which consults it on every enemy test.
server/sv_ai_factions.qc
server/sv_ai_combat.qc
// Squads.  Before sv_ai_core.qc, which calls into it on enemy acquisition, on
// every schedule change and on death; before the class files, which declare
// which attack slots their family rations.
server/sv_ai_squad.qc
// Take cover.  After sv_ai_squad.qc, because a cover spot is validated against
// where the monster's squadmates are standing; after server/sv_navnodes.qc,
// because it reads nav_pos[]/nav_air[] and the lookup grid directly rather than
// through an accessor; before sv_ai_core.qc, which owns TASK_FIND_COVER_ENEMY.
server/sv_ai_cover.qc
server/sv_ai_core.qc
// Gibs.  After sv_ai_core.qc because choosing a gib set reads .ai_class, and
// the damage path in sv_weapons.qc (compiled far earlier) reaches Monster_Gib
// through a forward declaration.
server/sv_ai_gibs.qc
